  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(x²+(1)/(x²⁾)=23\n\n**Concept used:**\n\n(x + (1)/(x))² = x² + (1)/(x²) + 2\n\n(x³+(1)/(x³⁾) = (x + (1)/(x))³ - 3(x + (1)/(x))\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(x²+(1)/(x²⁾)=23\n\n⇒ x² + (1)/(x²)+2=23 + 2\n\n⇒ x² + (1)/(x²)+2=25\n\n⇒ (x + (1)/(x))²=25\n\n⇒ (x + (1)/(x))=5\n\nNow,\n\n(x³+(1)/(x³⁾) = (x + (1)/(x))³ - 3(x + (1)/(x))\n\n⇒ (x³+(1)/(x³⁾) = 5³ - 3 × 5\n\n⇒ (x³+(1)/(x³⁾) = 125 - 15\n\n⇒ (x³+(1)/(x³⁾) = 110\n\n**∴ The required answer is 110.**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ca81259519cadfb2d5350673c220e419e60378e9770ad26512fc8e826a8d93f1.png] **__Shortcut Trick__**⇒(x²+(1)/(x²⁾)=k² -2\n\n⇒(x³+(1)/(x³⁾)=k³ -3k\n\n⇒ k² - 2 = 23\n\n⇒ k2 = 25 \n\n⇒ k = 5 \n\nthen,\n\nk³ - 3k = 5³ - 3 × 5 = 110",
